                <h2>High-Volume Air Circulation for Large Spaces</h2>
                <p>High Volume Low Speed (HVLS) fans are designed to move large amounts of air at low rotational speeds. They help circulate air across large floor areas and can support comfortable indoor conditions in warehouses, commercial facilities, industrial buildings, factory sheds, logistics hubs, gyms, and large halls. Their large diameter and aerodynamic blade design allow them to cover extensive areas from a central installation point.</p>
                <p>For large-area ventilation projects, <b>HVLS Fans Manufacturers in Bengaluru</b> offer air movement solutions designed around airflow coverage and energy-efficient operation. The current range covers 12 ft to 24 ft and offers stated airflow coverage from 229,000 CFM to 377,000 CFM. The fans also are designed to circulate air up to 20 metres from the fan centre in all directions.</p>
